warning[G007]: row_number() ordering has ties
 --> models/marts/latest_payment.sql:4:9
  |
4 | qualify row_number() over (partition by order_id order by paid_at desc) = 1
  |         ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ ORDER BY (paid_at) does not identify a row within PARTITION BY (order_id)
  |
  = note: the window's input has grain (payment_id), proven: key of ledger.payments from meta.derive.grain
  = note: rows that tie are numbered in arbitrary order: a dedup on this row_number keeps an arbitrary row, and reruns can keep a different one
  = help: add payment_id to the ORDER BY as a tie-breaker
  = see: derive explain G007

